====== MikroTik LHG-HB platform ======

{{page>meta:infobox:construction&noheader&nofooter&noeditbtn}}

The LHG-HB platform is the board design based on the Qualcomm Atheros QCA9533 used in various MikroTik wireless devices with 802.11b/g/n radio, 1x 10/100 Mbps Ethernet port, 16 MB SPI NOR flash and 64 MB RAM:
  * [[https://mikrotik.com/product/lhg_2|LHG 2]] (RBLHG-2nD)
  * [[https://mikrotik.com/product/sxtsq_lite2|SXTsq Lite2]] (RBSXTsq2nD)

and possibly also (untested):
  * [[https://mikrotik.com/product/ldf_2|LDF 2]] (RBLDF-2nD)
  * [[https://mikrotik.com/product/lhg_xl_2|LHG XL 2]] (RBLHG-2nD-XL)

===== MikroTik LHG 2 (RBLHG-2nD) =====

The LHG 2 (Light Head Grid) is a compact and light 802.11b/g/n outdoor wireless device with an integrated dual polarisation 18 dBi grid antenna and one 10/100 Mbps Ethernet port for point to point links or for use as a CPE.

{{:media:mikrotik:mikrotik_lhg-2_front.jpg?200|MikroTik LHG 2 (RBLHG-2nD) front view}} {{:media:mikrotik:mikrotik_lhg-2_bottom.jpg?200|MikroTik LHG 2 (RBLHG-2nD) bottom view}} {{:media:mikrotik:mikrotik_lhg-2_rear.jpg?200|MikroTik LHG 2 (RBLHG-2nD) rear view }} 

===== MikroTik SXTsq Lite 2 (RBSXTsq2nD) =====

The SXTsq Lite2 is a compact and lightweight 802.11b/g/n outdoor wireless device with an integrated 10 dBi antenna for point-to-point links or as a CPE unit, compact, weatherproof and easy to mount.

{{:media:mikrotik:mikrotik_sxtsq-lite2-front.jpg?200|MikroTik SXTsq Lite 2 (RBSXTsq2nD) front view}} {{:media:mikrotik:mikrotik_sxtsq-lite2-rear.jpg?200|MikroTik SXTsq Lite 2 (RBSXTsq2nD) rear view}} {{:media:mikrotik:mikrotik_sxtsq-lite2-side.jpg?200|MikroTik SXTsq Lite 2 (RBSXTsq2nD) side view}}

